          "text": "## September Pending Close review\n\n- **Work order:** MO-25-09-1070 (**WO-2025-09-004**)\n- **Source transaction:** TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070 — component input\n- **Amount:** **$318,250.75** (31,825,075 cents)\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30T20:25:00\n- **September cost period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30T18:00:00\n- **Time after Pending Close:** **145 minutes (2 hours 25 minutes)**\n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n\n**Conclusion:** The POSTED status is **not consistent** with Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B’s documented treatment: newly created transactions that fall in or before a Pending Close period are not staged in Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened. The review was read-only; no database records were changed.\n\nThe task report was submitted and verified.",
